    },
    "Show open tasks in the dock" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在程序坞中显示未完成的任务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finder access can be requested here now, so reveal-in-Finder and Trash actions work without waiting for the first macOS prompt." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在即可在这里申请Finder访问权限，让在Finder中显示和废纸篓操作直接可用，无需等待首次 macOS 提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Events access can be requested here now for curated menu-click actions. Accessibility should be enabled too, since UI scripting depends on both permissions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在即可在这里申请System Events访问权限，用于精选的菜单点击操作。同时也应启用辅助功能权限，因为界面脚本依赖这两项权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permission unlocks a core Docky feature, but you can skip it for now and grant it later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此权限用于启用 Docky 的核心功能，你可以暂时跳过，稍后再授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permission unlocks an optional feature and can be granted later from Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此权限用于启用可选功能，可以稍后在设置中授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Granted" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
