          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Controls how much each divider is inset along its short axis, as a fraction of the tile size." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置各分隔线沿短轴方向的内缩量，以图标项大小的比例表示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shifts dividers along the tile's short axis. Positive values move them up in horizontal docks or right in vertical docks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沿图标项的短轴移动分隔线。正值使水平程序坞中的分隔线上移，或使垂直程序坞中的分隔线右移。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scales custom divider images. Has no effect on the default line." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整自定义分隔线图片的大小。对默认分隔线无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Controls how visible dividers are. 100% is fully opaque; 0% hides them entirely." : {
