    },
    "While the switcher is open, keep the shortcut modifiers held and tap the shortcut again to cycle. In Instant Focus mode, each step immediately focuses the next window and releasing the modifiers ends cycling." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切换器打开时，按住快捷键的修饰键，再次按下快捷键即可循环切换。在即时聚焦模式下，每次切换都会立即聚焦下一个窗口，松开修饰键后结束切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While the switcher is open, keep the shortcut modifiers held and tap the shortcut again to cycle. Release the modifiers to focus the selected window." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切换器打开时，按住快捷键的修饰键，再次按下快捷键即可循环切换。松开修饰键后聚焦所选窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
